1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:05,200
Paper Moon Cafe

2
00:00:06,000 --> 00:00:08,500
<i>Rain taps on the window.</i>

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:11,800
One moon latte, please.
Extra cinnamon.

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:15,000
We close at midnight,
but the moon stays open.

5
00:00:15,800 --> 00:00:18,000
- Is this seat taken?
- Only by the cat.

6
00:00:18,500 --> 00:00:21,200
He has been waiting here
since the first snow.

7
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:24,500
<b>Last order!</b>

8
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,000
See you under the paper moon.
